---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Logo from '../components/Logo.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Dave Randall and Thunder Creek Creative Solutions.">
  <div class="wrap about">
    <img class="portrait" src="/images/dave-randall.jpg" alt="Dave Randall" width="280" height="280" />
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Dave Randall</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        I write practical, plain-language guidance on Microsoft Intune for the people who run it every day,
        and for the partners who run it for their customers.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm a former Product Manager at Microsoft for Intune and Configuration Manager. I developed and delivered
        strategic initiatives in device management that met key horizontal product needs: third-party integration,
        role security, and product automation.
      </p>
      <p>
        I worked closely with internal and external partners to build solutions that extend and automate Intune for
        enterprise device management and software delivery. Role security and automation are exactly what my RBAC and
        Graph series cover.
      </p>

      <h2>How this site works</h2>
      <p>
        Each of my LinkedIn series gets a permanent home here. Every daily post links to a page with the full
        diagram, the details that don't fit in a LinkedIn post, and links to Microsoft's documentation. The
        pages stay up after a series ends, and I update them when Intune changes.
      </p>

      <h2>Thunder Creek Creative Solutions</h2>
      <div class="co">
        <Logo size={40} label="Thunder Creek Creative Solutions logo" />
        <p>This site is published by Thunder Creek Creative Solutions.</p>
      </div>

      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>The best way to reach me is a message on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dave-randall-6636333/">LinkedIn</a>. If you have a question for a series, post it as a comment on that day's post.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .about { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 280px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 56px; padding-top: 56px; align-items: start; }
  .portrait { width: 280px; height: 280px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 14px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem); letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.05; margin: 8px 0 16px; }
  .lead { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .co { display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center; }
  .co p { margin: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; padding-top: 32px; }
    .portrait { width: 160px; height: 160px; border-radius: 50%; }
  }
</style>
